WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
You open your bag on Monday, and it smells like nothing.

2
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:08.480
No linen, no pine, no fake scent manufactured to mask the odor.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.800
Just... nothing.

4
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.880
And that's the point.

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.920
Jack Shock uses EPA registered zero point to kill the funk,

6
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.920
specifically meant for gear.

7
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.600
No flinch, no joke, no apology.
